    <div style="width: 1440px; height: 2878px; align-items: center; background-color: #F5F5F5; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 12px; font-synthesis: none; line-height: 16px; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding-bottom: 96px; padding-top: 88px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.02em; line-height: 56px">常见问题</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; margin-top: 12px">关于数据准确性、适用人群与使用限制的说明</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; column-gap: 60px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 48px; row-gap: 20px; width: 1180px"><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">HOOP 是医疗器械吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">不是。HOOP 手环与 NEXTBODY App 均非医疗器械，不用于诊断、治疗、治愈或预防任何疾病。心率、血氧、HRV、皮肤温度、睡眠、身体成分、准备度、训练负荷等数据与提示仅供日常健康管理参考，不作为诊疗依据。如有身体不适，请及时就医并遵从医生建议。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">身体扫描（BIA）测出来的体脂准吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">身体扫描通过生物电阻抗测得阻抗值，再结合你在 App 中填写的身高、体重、年龄与性别推算身体成分，结果为估算值，可能与体脂秤、DEXA 等方法存在差异。测量时电流在双臂与上身之间形成回路，下半身成分为推算所得。饮水、进食、运动、出汗与测量时段都会影响结果，建议每次在相同条件下测量（如晨起空腹、排尿后、运动前），更适合观察长期趋势。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">哪些人不能使用身体扫描？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">体内植入心脏起搏器、植入式心律转复除颤器等电子医疗设备的人群请勿使用身体扫描。孕妇、体内有金属植入物者，以及接触部位皮肤有破损或炎症时不建议使用，结果也可能不准确。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">身体扫描里的体重和基础代谢是手环测的吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">不是。手环不能称重，身体扫描使用你在 App 中录入的最近一次体重，脂肪量与去脂体重由该体重和体脂率计算得出，因此请在扫描前更新体重。身体扫描给出的基础代谢为设备估算参考值；App 计算每日热量目标时，使用基于身高、体重、年龄与性别的公式估算静息代谢，两者可能不同。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">睡眠分数是怎么算的？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">睡眠分数满分 100，由七项睡眠因素按 HOOP 自有规则加权得出：总睡眠时长 40、快速眼动 15、深睡 15、睡眠效率 10、睡眠安稳度 10、入睡潜伏期 5、入睡时机 5，缺少数据的项目不计分，其余项目重新归一。入睡潜伏期目前不参与计算。这套规则参考了 Oura 公开的睡眠因素，但不是 Oura 的算法，也不是临床量表。心率、HRV、血氧与呼吸率为辅助数据，不计入睡眠分数。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">为什么有的晚上没有快速眼动（REM）数据？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">是否记录到快速眼动取决于当晚手环生成的睡眠记录类型。某一晚没有 REM 数据，表示当晚未进行该项测量，不代表你没有 REM 睡眠；这一晚的睡眠分数会按其余项目重新归一。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">夜间血氧低、HRV 低，是不是身体出了问题？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">夜间血氧仅在记录到的睡眠时段自动测量，提供当晚的平均值、最低值与曲线，不用于诊断或分级睡眠呼吸暂停。夜间 HRV 为睡眠期间的 RMSSD，可作为疲劳与恢复状态的参考。睡眠呼吸率同样只在睡眠时段记录，本产品没有日间呼吸监测。佩戴过松、夜间体动、手臂受压、环境温度过低等都可能影响读数；如数据长期异常或伴有不适，请咨询医生。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">准备度和训练负荷的建议可以直接照着练吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">动态训练准备度（0–100）以昨晚的睡眠为起点，对比你近期的夜间 HRV 与静息心率个人基线；训练负荷（0–21）每 5 分钟结算一次心率区间与活动量。个人基线需要连续佩戴逐步建立，前两周会更多参考大众水平。二者均为算法估算，建议仅供参考，不能替代教练或医生的专业指导；运动中如出现胸闷、头晕、心悸等不适，请立即停止并就医。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">页面上的心率准确度 98.2% 是什么意思？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">该数值为特定测试场景与条件下得出的结果。实际使用中，佩戴松紧与位置、运动强度、手腕毛发、纹身、肤色、皮肤湿度与环境温度等因素都可能影响心率读数，准确度可能有所不同。剧烈或不规则的手腕动作（如力量训练、球类运动）时读数波动可能较大。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">HOOP 可以戴着游泳、洗澡吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">HOOP 达到 IP68 防尘防水等级，日常洗手、雨天、出汗及泳池等浅水运动时可以佩戴。不适用于潜水、跳水、热水淋浴、温泉、桑拿、高速水流等场景；在海水或泳池中使用后请用清水冲洗并擦干。请勿在水中或皮肤潮湿时进行身体扫描。尼龙表带浸水后需要较长时间晾干，长期潮湿可能引起皮肤不适。防水性能并非永久有效，可能随使用时间下降。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">充一次电真的能用 5 天吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">5 天续航为特定测试条件下的结果。实际续航会因监测设置、运动时长、身体扫描与主动测量次数、与手机同步的频率、环境温度等不同而有所差异，电池容量也会随使用时间逐渐衰减。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">10g、8mm 是怎么算的？和其他产品的对比可信吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">8mm 与 10g 为机身数据，不含表带；由于测量位置、方法与工具不同，结果可能存在差异，请以实物为准。重量对比图中各产品均为不含表带的实测值，其他产品的重量可能因型号、版本与批次不同而有所差异，对比仅用于说明重量差别。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">饮食记录的热量和营养素准确吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">餐食的热量、蛋白质、碳水与脂肪基于食物种类与份量描述估算，不是称重或实验室测定结果，可能与实际摄入存在差异。每日热量与营养目标为一般性建议，不构成营养处方；孕期、哺乳期、患有慢性病或有特殊饮食需求的人群请遵医嘱。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">把数据接入 ChatGPT、Claude 等 AI（MCP）安全吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">接入需要你本人登录并授权，AI 助手只能读取你自己账号下的数据。记录餐食默认关闭，开启后 AI 会在保存前与你确认食物、份量与时间。数据一旦发送给第三方 AI 服务，将按照该服务的隐私政策处理，请自行评估后使用。AI 助手给出的分析与建议仅供参考，不构成医疗、营养或训练处方。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">HOOP 支持哪些手机？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">NEXTBODY App 支持 iOS 17 及以上版本的 iPhone，以及 Android 9 及以上版本的 Android 手机。使用前请将手环固件与 App 更新至最新版本，部分功能以实际 App 为准。</div></div></div><div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-shrink: 0; gap: 10px; padding-block: 26px; padding-inline: 28px; width: 560px"><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">Q</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Semibold&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 26px">页面里的配色和界面跟实物一样吗？</div></div><div style="align-items: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #9A9BA0; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;Jost&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 20px">A</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; display: inline-block; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px">表带颜色、纹理可能因拍摄、灯光与显示设备不同而存在差异，请以实物为准。页面中的手机界面为 NEXTBODY App 实际界面截图，所示数据为演示数据；人物与场景图片仅供示意，功能与界面可能随版本更新而变化。</div></div></div></div><div style="border-top-color: #E2E2E4; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-top: 80px; padding-top: 36px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #555659; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Medium&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px">注释</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">1.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">薄至 8mm、轻至 10g 为机身数据，不含表带；因测量位置、方法与工具不同，结果可能存在差异，请以实物为准。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">2.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">弹性编织尼龙表带适配腕围约 135–210 mm，不同表带适配范围可能不同。「一戴就忘」「整夜佩戴无感」等为主观佩戴感受，因人而异。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">3.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">重量对比图中各产品重量均为不含表带的实测值，其他产品数据可能因型号、版本与批次不同而有所差异，对比仅用于说明重量差别。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">4.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">四款配色包括编织尼龙与蜂窝硅胶两种材质，表带采用魔术贴快拆，更换无需工具。表带颜色、纹理请以实物为准；编织表带浸水或大量出汗后请及时晾干。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">5.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">心率准确度 98.2% 为特定测试场景与条件下的结果，实际使用中可能因佩戴松紧、运动强度、手腕毛发、纹身、肤色及环境因素等，准确度有所不同。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">6.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">心率全天自动监测；血氧仅在记录到的睡眠时段自动测量，不用于诊断或分级睡眠呼吸暂停；皮肤温度为手腕表面温度，不等同于体温，不能用于判断发热或疾病。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">7.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">睡眠算法 2.0 与 Oura Ring 的对比为同一人、同一晚同时佩戴的单次结果，总睡眠时长不计入清醒时长；「总睡眠时长一致性 99.5%」即指该次对比，不同个体与不同夜晚的结果可能不同，不代表临床研究结论。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">8.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">睡眠分数由七项睡眠因素加权得出（总睡眠时长 40、快速眼动 15、深睡 15、睡眠效率 10、睡眠安稳度 10、入睡潜伏期 5、入睡时机 5），缺少数据的项目重新归一，入睡潜伏期目前不参与计算。该规则参考 Oura 公开的睡眠因素，由 HOOP 自行制定，非 Oura 专有算法，亦非临床量表。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">9.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">深睡、浅睡与快速眼动分期由手环根据心率与体动数据推算；是否记录到快速眼动取决于当晚的睡眠记录类型，未记录不代表没有快速眼动睡眠。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">10.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">夜间 HRV 为睡眠期间的 RMSSD，可作为疲劳与恢复状态的参考，但不作为诊疗依据。HRV 与静息心率的个人基线从第 14 个有效夜开始逐步建立，佩戴过松或夜间体动过多可能影响准确性。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">11.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">动态训练准备度（0–100）以昨晚的睡眠为起点，对比近 14 天的夜间 HRV 与静息心率个人基线，白天每 5 分钟更新一次。训练负荷（0–21）每 5 分钟结算心率区间与活动量，日常活动与运动不重复计算，每日建议范围随睡眠情况调整。二者均为算法估算，仅供参考。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">12.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">「11 大类、67 项健康数据」以 App 实际展示为准，可能随版本更新调整。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">13.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">身体扫描基于生物电阻抗原理，单次约 30 秒，需手指按住侧键。14 项身体成分（BMI、基础代谢、体脂率、脂肪量、皮下脂肪率、去脂体重、肌肉率、肌肉量、骨骼肌率、体水分率、水分量、骨量、蛋白质率、蛋白质量）为基于阻抗与用户录入的身高、体重、年龄、性别推算的估算值。体重由用户录入，并非手环测量。体内植入心脏起搏器等电子医疗设备者禁止使用。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">14.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">「充一次 5 天」为特定测试条件下的结果，实际续航因监测设置、运动时长、身体扫描与主动测量次数、同步频率与环境温度等不同而有所差异，电池容量会随使用时间衰减。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">15.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">「每 5 分钟记录一次」指全天健康数据按 5 分钟粒度汇总呈现，不同指标的实际采样频率可能不同。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">16.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">48 种运动模式以 App 实际支持为准。运动中的心率、时长、距离与热量消耗为手环测量与算法估算结果，可能与 GPS、跑步机或其他设备存在差异。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">17.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">IP68 防尘防水，不适用于潜水、跳水、热水淋浴、温泉、桑拿、高速水流等场景；请勿在水中或皮肤潮湿时进行身体扫描。防水性能并非永久有效，可能随使用时间下降。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px; text-align: right; width: 22px">18.</div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-basis: 0%; flex-grow: 1; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 21px">饮食热量与营养素为基于食物种类与份量描述的估算，不是称重或实验室测定结果；每日热量与营养目标为一般性建议，不构成营养处方。</div></div><div style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; width: 1180px"><div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: #8A8B90; display: inline-block; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: &quot;PingFangSC-Regular&qu